# Framework generates: based on .kaira.json "auth_type" setting
#
# Supported Auth:
#   - jwt         → PyJWT / python-jose
#   - oauth2      → Authlib
#   - api-key     → secrets / hashlib
#   - sso         → Authlib SSO
#
# Password hashing:
#   - argon2      → argon2-cffi (primary)
#   - bcrypt      → bcrypt (fallback)

